# Dirtree: Stateful directory trees in the CLI for humans and LLMs. https://github.com/pmarreck/dirtree
ver=1.2
annotate=[
	.githooks = Repository-local Git hooks refresh materialized Codex skills after checkout or merge.
	MECHATRON_PRIME_CI.md = Portable Mechatron Prime CI target, webhook, and badge policy.
	install = Installs Claude symlink or portable copied Codex skills; --sync enables repository-local refresh hooks.
	mechatron-ci = Shared Mechatron Prime CI skill with Codex UI metadata.
	memories = Shared cross-agent workflow for typed durable memory recall, migration, validation, and consolidation.
	memories/scripts/check-frontmatter = Validates and lists only the YAML headers of frontmatter Markdown memories.
	memories/scripts/migrate-legacy = Previews or safely migrates legacy memories with creation times and lexical tag aliases.
	test = Runs the complete llm_skills installer regression suite.
	tests/cli/test_codex_sync = Integration coverage for portable hook-driven Codex sync, recovery backups, and local-skill preservation.
	tests/cli/test_install = Regression tests for CLI installer options, copied Codex skills, and rerun safety.
]
